# Allowlist. The build context carries only what the Dockerfile copies:
# everything else is either already compiled into .next.tar.gz or unused at
# runtime, and shipping it just slows the build and enlarges the context.
*

!.next.tar.gz
!package.json
!server.mjs
!public
!scenarios
!studies
!scripts

# Never, regardless of the rules above.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/node_modules
**/.DS_Store
